"{\"reasoning\":\"GBW requirement gives gm1\u2248157\u00b5S. With Itail\u226415\u00b5A each input transistor carries \u22487.5\u00b5A, yielding gm/Id\u224821\u202fV\u207b\u00b9 (within 4\u201124). Choosing L\u22481\u00b5m gives high gm/gds (~400 for NMOS, ~650 for PMOS) so gds2\u22480.4\u00b5S, gds4\u22480.24\u00b5S, giving A0\u2248245 (48\u202fdB) >45\u202fdB. Mirror pole f\u2248gm3/(2\u03c0CL)\u22485\u202fMHz, providing \u224860\u00b0 PM. Vdsat\u22480.3\u202fV gives output swing \u22482.4\u202fV >1.5\u202fV. Power =3.3\u202fV\u00b72\u00b7Itail\u224899\u202f\u00b5W \u2264100\u202f\u00b5W. Thus specs are met.\",\"gmid1\":21,\"L1_um\":1,\"gmid3\":21,\"L3_um\":1,\"gmid5\":21,\"L5_um\":1,\"Itail_uA\":15}"